  "content": "\n\n<p>這是一個非常簡單的模組，用於修復 Minecraft 中的鏡頭異常問題。</p>\n<p>在 Minecraft 中，當您處於第三人稱模式時，若您站在無碰撞方塊（例如高草）內，鏡頭可能會直接貼在您的角色頭上，這相當惱人。</p>\n<p>因此，如果您喜歡以第三人稱視角探索，這個模組絕對適合您！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>一些範例：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kVtNX1t.png\" alt=\"未安裝此模組\" width=\"240\" height=\"135\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NG2MWDX.png\" alt=\"已安裝此模組\" width=\"240\" height=\"135\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;未安裝此模組&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;已安裝此模組</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DrPp3tY.png\" alt=\"未安裝此模組\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MSzDx7H.png\" alt=\"已安裝此模組\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"></p>",
